<h2 class="lead" id="custom">A heading</h2>
<h3 id="second-level">Second level</h3>
<p>Text with <strong>bold</strong>, <em>emphasis</em>, <del>strike</del>, <code>code</code>, &ldquo;quotes&rdquo; &ndash; and dashes&hellip;</p>
<ul>
<li><input checked="" disabled="" type="checkbox"> done</li>
<li><input disabled="" type="checkbox"> to do</li>
</ul>
<p>A bare link: <a href="https://example.com">https://example.com</a>, and <a href="https://example.com/a" title="Title">one with text</a>.</p>
<dl>
<dt>Term</dt>
<dd>Its definition.</dd>
</dl>
<p>A footnote<sup id="fnref:1"><a href="#fn:1" class="footnote-ref" role="doc-noteref">1</a></sup>.</p>
<hr>
<div class="footnotes" role="doc-endnotes">
<hr>
<ol>
<li id="fn:1">
<p>The note.&#160;<a href="#fnref:1" class="footnote-backref" role="doc-backlink">&#x21a9;&#xfe0e;</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
